abstract: >-
  Programs and input data accompanying the article "Normalization verification of optical and transfer matrix
  elements in semiconductor heterostructures" (submitted to Computer Physics Communications). The single entry
  point run_all.py regenerates the computed tables and the eight figures of the article and compares them with the
  expected values in expected_outputs.json; README.md maps the article's figures and tables to programs and data.
  Program code: MIT; data, tables and figures: CC BY 4.0.
